OL,3,AFrench hard-right leader accuses
OL,4,Aopponents of 'total war' after claims
OL,5,Aof antisemitism
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe president of France's hard-right
OL,8,FNational Rally (RN), Jordan Bardella,
OL,9,Fhas said he will sue for libel after a
OL,10,Freport published antisemitic comments
OL,11,Fthat it alleged he had made as a young
OL,12,Factivist.
OL,14,FThe Mediapart website released what it
OL,15,Fsaid was the result of "several months"
OL,16,Fof investigation into "dozens of
OL,17,Fwritten conversations" Bardella
OL,18,Fallegedly had in 2013.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
