OL,3,AFrench hard-right leader accuses
OL,4,Aopponents of 'total war' after claims
OL,5,Aof antisemitism
OL,6,
OL,7,FWith seven months to go before France's
OL,8,Fpresidential elections, Bardella
OL,9,Fcondemned "the beginnings of a total
OL,10,Fwar" aimed at destabilising his party,
OL,11,Fand RN presidential candidate Marine Le
OL,12,FPen said she had total confidence in
OL,13,Fhim.
OL,15,FThe alleged remarks included blatantly
OL,16,Fantisemitic tropes, and Bardella said
OL,17,Fthey were an attempt to destroy his
OL,18,Fpolitical career.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
